    "created_at": "2016-07-18T13:10:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-18T13:10:26Z",
    "body": "I've only tested in stable Firefox and Chrome. In Firefox 47 the details element needs to be enabled in `about:config`, see: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/details#Browser_compatibility (v48+ it's enabled by default). In v47 which I tested with though, it seems like support for the element is still half baked and the `toggle` event doesn't fire _at all_ (even on the element).\nIn the latest stable Chrome, the event fires only on the element and does not bubble, as specified by the spec (or by lack of additional specification that it should bubble).\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
