    "created_at": "2016-07-18T14:02:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-18T14:02:52Z",
    "body": "The specification is quite clear in that it shouldn't bubble. However, if it's more useful for developers if it does, perhaps we should reconsider.\n\n@aethanyc @tkent-google thoughts?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
