    "created_at": "2016-07-19T09:44:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-19T09:44:41Z",
    "body": "Firefox implemented the toggle events in [Bug 1225412](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1225412) which is in Firefox 48. Firefox certainly does follow the spec, but I see no reason that the toggle event cannot bubble. And it should be trivial to implement the bubbling.\n\n@smaug---- any concerns?\n",
