    "updated_at": "2016-07-19T16:44:51Z",
    "body": "If you click on something inside something else, it's arguable that you clicked on the outer thing too. (I.e., not only did I click on the button, I also clicked on the document; both are true, and both objects should be notified of the click.) Whereas if you toggle a details inside another details, you definitely didn't toggle the outer details.\n",
